---
import CourseHome from '../../../../components/course/CourseHome.astro';
import { ENGINEERING_ENTRANCE } from '../../../../courses/engineering-entrance/syllabus';
import '../../../../styles/lesson-kit.css';
---
<CourseHome course={ENGINEERING_ENTRANCE}>
  <section class="cs-builds">
    <h2>How this course takes you from basics to a top rank</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>One clear order.</strong> Start here, then Physics, Chemistry and Maths chapter by chapter, in the order schools teach them. Each chapter has a lesson that explains the ideas and a lesson on every question type the exams build from it.</li>
      <li><strong>Learn it without a teacher.</strong> Every idea starts from something you can picture, moves step by step with animations, and says what each formula means physically before you use it.</li>
      <li><strong>Every kind of question.</strong> Single answer, multi-correct, integer and decimal answers, assertion-reason, statements, match the columns and paragraph questions, including the ones that mix two chapters or hide a trap.</li>
      <li><strong>Five levels.</strong> Level 1 is board practice, 2 is KEAM, CUSAT and COMEDK, 3 is JEE Main, 4 is the hardest JEE Main questions, and 5 is JEE Advanced top-rank level.</li>
      <li><strong>Practice that never runs out.</strong> Number questions come from templates that give fresh values every time, with a full worked solution for each one. All questions are original fibub work.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Free, no sign-up. Your progress stays in this browser: tick "Remember my progress" below, or save it as a file, so you can pick up where you stopped.</p>
  </section>
</CourseHome>
